    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d380">

                <pb facs="0461" n="349" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg349"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/4539: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-05-16T20:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 16, 1919, 8
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>My May 15th, 6 p.m. President directs me to request that you particularly inquire
                    as to the kind of men and influences surrounding Kolchak and ask whether in your opinion Kolchak is strong enough and liberal enough to
                    control them in the right direction.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
